36,2,1,talk,May,,"@Minato, two firms is tight, but my ledger says planted ground costs triple to maintain. With only seven staff left, who pays that bill?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"@May, the ledger is frightening, but the past is clearer. The old basin still stands, yet the avenue trees died from neglect. We must plan for care, not just planting.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"@May, the ledger confirms my fear. With only seven staff, we cannot absorb triple costs. I need to know if the volunteer groups can bridge that gap.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"@Minato, the clay is a nuisance, not a wall. My data shows people ignore soft margins and drainage is failing. We need firm ground, not just a schedule.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Shunichi, I see. But with only two firms, even shallow work is risky. Can we really trust the ground to hold?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
